## Finam onboarding widget (CDN embed)

Release distribution is done via **Git tags**.

- Publish a new tag for each release: `v1.0.1`, `v1.0.2`, ...
- Use jsDelivr with an explicit tag (do not use `latest`).

URL template:

`https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/filentio/finam@<TAG>/widget/finam-onboarding-widget.js`


